<title>JAPAN: Japan aluminium alloy output, shipments up in 1996.</title>
<headline>Japan aluminium alloy output, shipments up in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy rose marginally in 1996 from the year before, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>The data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    1996	  yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	  924,620	 +0.2 pct</p>
<p> Shipments     934,803	 +0.8 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
